  "formula": "outcrop = clip(resistance[rock_class] * shallowness * terrain * (1 - tree_cover_pct/100 * 0.5) * lidar, 0, 1); shallowness = clip((150 - depth_to_bedrock_cm) / (150 - 25), 0, 1) (0 where depth unknown); terrain = min(slope_deg / 35, 1) + 0.5 * clip(TPI_m / 1.5, 0, 1), TPI = z - mean(z, 150 m window) on the DEM averaged to 30 m; tree cover from LANDFIRE EVC; water = 0; lidar = 0.5 + min(roughness_m / 0.12, 1.5), roughness = 30 m mean of terrain/roughness_10m.tif (std of the 1 m lidar DEM about a quadratic fitted per 10 m cell)",
